{
  "id": "30",
  "title": "论母",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“论母”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "正印者，乃生我之身也。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-3298a8124f2064372afe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如甲日以癸为母，遇己丑未主剋母；见多，主母嫁二夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-322bd2b273268e502e41-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "一戊失地、或被剋，主母伤前夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-4d46c03af96c4de05f57-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戊字受生、或印临桃花沐浴，母有外情。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-e35dbee9dd926795cab6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如印长生，主母慈淑寿长、益和子母。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-3f45d2a52c25217cc7b7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如临阳刃杀地、或值绝墓孤寡，主母不贤或有残疾不睦。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-6e0977c640376bf2e82f-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "须以理推，无不验矣！",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "30-dd1f46b16f73aaea1902-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
